WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:02.369
You now have a woke mind virus

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:03.809
has infected all these other

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:04.919
institutions.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.179
I mean, just look at corporate

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.049
America.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.089
Most corporations, some of these big

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:12.239
corporations are now exercising

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.249
quasi public power.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.589
Is it time to fight fire with fire,

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:18.359
to wield government power, to stop a

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.339
dangerous ideology from destroying

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.619
