00:07:50.062 --> 00:07:51.499
Sara Margulis and her husband

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.539
co-founded Honeyfund, a Clearwater,

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.799
Florida, based company that

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:56.899
