00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.359
What was in the trainings that

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:10.879
you believe might have run afoul

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.099
of those kinds of restrictions?

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.049
So one thing

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:17.149
that comes to mind is the idea

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:19.339
of privilege that white people

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:21.769
or males have privilege that

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.169
nonwhite people or females don't

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:25.159
enjoy.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:26.209
And I think that

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:29.149
the the concept

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:31.129
of that, the idea of that is not

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:32.449
something for us to shy away from

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.759
understanding and actively

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.918
trying to mitigate

00:08:36.919 --> 00:08:38.029
in our business.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.709
DeSantis office declined our

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:41.569
interview requests, but his press

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:43.399
reps responded by email that

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.259
because the concepts are forced on

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:46.699
